Each card links to that tool's evidence.
Generated by `bench/parity/parity.py` on 2026-10-17, against zanity `7c4a2e5`.


# Summary

Each rule has a small fixture written to trigger it, and counts as matched when the tool fires on its fixture and zanity does too; a rule with no fixture counts as a miss. bonsai is scored by its findings in its own fixtures, and nouls by the questions it asks a model. Green: zanity matches all of them. Amber: some. Red: none.

```=html
<div class="scoreboard">
<a href="nasa-lsp/" class="card pass"><div class="card-name">nasa-lsp</div><div class="card-score">11<span>/11</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></a>
<a href="testdesiderata/" class="card partial"><div class="card-name">testdesiderata</div><div class="card-score">38<span>/39</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:97%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></a>
<a href="mockbuster/" class="card partial"><div class="card-name">mockbuster</div><div class="card-score">4<span>/6</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:67%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></a>
<a href="dddlint/" class="card partial"><div class="card-name">dddlint</div><div class="card-score">10<span>/12</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:83%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></a>
<a href="bonsai/" class="card partial"><div class="card-name">bonsai</div><div class="card-score">181<span>/262</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:69%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">findings matched</div></a>
<a href="nouls/" class="card partial"><div class="card-name">nouls</div><div class="card-score">30<span>/505</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:6%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">questions zanity also asks</div></a>
</div>
```

